{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1179417-matt-the-bruins-fan-s-exalted-art","id":1179417,"title":"Matt the Bruins fan's Exalted art","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-25T20:26:57-08:00","id":1179417,"title":"Matt the Bruins fan's Exalted art","content":"I've got a couple of pieces of Exalted character art worked up to the point that I'm okay with showing them to people, so I figured I'd make a thread for posting them and others I may come up with moving forward.<br /> <br /> First up is the first potential character I made for 3rd Edition: Unfortunate Kelp (Lintha Sennong falong Cousin Tang to those who know him well), a Lintha pirate who's usually based around Wu-Jian doing smuggling work and other endeavors of questionable legality for the family.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://c1.staticflickr.com/5/4722/25025835337_6da6d81c4f_b.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3505,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","user":"Matt the Bruins fan","date":". 01-26-2018, 12:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":15}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T20:43:43-08:00","id":1179425,"title":"","content":"And this is Late-Flowering Plum, a Vanehan minstrel who wanders the Scavenger Lands and beyond bringing news, entrancing crowds with her songs, and laying low evildoers with the razor sharp notes of her tanpura.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://c1.staticflickr.com/5/4653/26024505078_8ce5e5e1f6_b.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3505,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","user":"Matt the Bruins fan","date":". 01-26-2018, 12:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T16:18:43-08:00","id":1185761,"title":"","content":"And here's Unfortunate Kelp in a scene with panoramic background. I may tweak this one some more after revisiting, but I'm happy enough with it at the moment to display it.<br /> <img src=\"https://c1.staticflickr.com/5/4626/26381074158_4f7d81eb84_b.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T18:27:26-08:00","id":1185792,"title":"","content":"Thanks for sharing. I really enjoyed them!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12440-drakor","name":"drakor","avatar":"https: